{"suttaId":"tha-ap104","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[5177,5195],"vripara":"7"},"segments":{"tha-ap104:0.3":"Ñāṇasaññikattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap104:1.1":"“Suvaṇṇavaṇṇaṃ sambuddhaṃ, nisabhājāniyaṃ yathā;","tha-ap104:1.3":"Tidhāpabhinnaṃ mātaṅgaṃ, kuñjaraṃva mahesinaṃ.","tha-ap104:2.1":"“Obhāsentaṃ disā sabbā, uḷurājaṃva pūritaṃ;","tha-ap104:2.3":"Rathiyaṃ paṭipajjantaṃ, lokajeṭṭhaṃ apassahaṃ.","tha-ap104:3.1":"“Ñāṇe cittaṃ pasādetvā, paggahetvāna añjaliṃ;","tha-ap104:3.3":"Pasannacitto sumano, siddhatthamabhivādayiṃ.","tha-ap104:4.1":"“Catunnavutito kappe, yaṃ kammamakariṃ tadā;","tha-ap104:4.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, ñāṇasaññāyidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap104:5.1":"“Tesattatimhito kappe, soḷasāsuṃ naruttamā;","tha-ap104:5.3":"Sattaratanasampannā, cakkavattī mahabbalā.","tha-ap104:6.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap104:7.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā ñāṇasaññiko thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap104:8.1":"Ñāṇasaññikattherassāpadānaṃ dutiyaṃ."},"attha":{"book":"Ap-a","bookName":"Apadāna-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0510a.att","from":2804,"to":2804,"paras":[{"para":2804,"vripara":"7","refs":["tha-ap104:1"],"lines":["So aparabhāge attano pubbakammaṃ saritvā somanassajāto pubbacaritāpadānaṃ pakāsento <b>suvaṇṇavaṇṇaṃ sambuddhan</b>tiādimāha.","Taṃ vuttatthameva.","<b>Nisabhājāniyaṃ yathā</b>ti gavasatasahassajeṭṭho nisabho, nisabho ca so ājāniyo seṭṭho uttamo ceti nisabhājāniyo.","Yathā nisabhājāniyo, tatheva bhagavāti attho.","Lokavisayasaññātaṃ paññattivasena evaṃ vuttaṃ.","Anupameyyo hi bhagavā.","Sesaṃ sabbattha uttānatthamevāti."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap104:1"],["tha-ap104:1"],["tha-ap104:1"],["tha-ap104:1"],["tha-ap104:1"],["tha-ap104:1"],["tha-ap104:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[["tha-ap104:1.1","suvaṇṇavaṇṇaṃ sambuddhaṃ",0,0],["tha-ap104:1.1","nisabhājāniyaṃ yathā",0,2]]},"tika":null}
